    "detailed_description": "<h1>While you wait for Vendir: Plague of Lies</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><strong>CRPG-Classic Ambiance in a Dynamic World:</strong><br>Set foot in a sprawling, interactive world that reverberates with the essence of classic computer role-playing games. From bustling towns to eerie dungeons, the Land of Vendir beckons for exploration.<br><br><strong>Engaging Turn-Based Combat:</strong><br>Dive into strategic battles that fuse intuitive mechanics with depth. Choose to engage with melee, spells, or a blend of both, and exploit enemy weaknesses to claim victory.<br><br><strong>Extensive Exploration and Loot System:</strong><br>Traverse the diverse terrains of Vendir, uncovering secrets, treasures, and lore. Equip and upgrade gear, and delve into the connection between items and the overarching narrative.<br><br><strong>Deep Character Customization:</strong><br>With a vast skill tree boasting hundreds of abilities, tailor your characters based on your playstyle. Choose from classes like Warrior, Thief, Necromancer, and Mage, and experiment with synergies for varied gameplay experiences.<br><br><strong>Choice-Driven Narrative:</strong><br>Interact with NPCs in dialogues rich in lore, where your choices carve out the story's direction. Every decision could have ramifications, leading to multiple story outcomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><br>Embark on a harrowing journey in a land where darkness overshadows hope. The Land of Vendir, tainted by the Royal Family's oppressive reign, is a realm of despair, where life's value is less than the mud on one's boots.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b0ad53e96496acf2ef7daf9eb1890a5b.poster.avif?t=1717138373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b0ad53e96496acf2ef7daf9eb1890a5b.webm?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b0ad53e96496acf2ef7daf9eb1890a5b.mp4?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Amidst the chaos, whispers of an ancient prophecy surface, proclaiming the rise of heroes who would challenge the throne. But in a world where public intoxication leads to execution, and debts unpaid result in a fiery death, do these foretold saviors dare to rise?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/991c701fae6635e4477d0349aa8571f5.poster.avif?t=1717138373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/991c701fae6635e4477d0349aa8571f5.webm?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/991c701fae6635e4477d0349aa8571f5.mp4?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Journey across the treacherous landscapes of Vendir, rallying allies and avoiding King Elrik's wrathful gaze. As the Eighth Era unfolds, destiny awaits the brave.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b206694e2852f2c6734ae27d545e87f3.poster.avif?t=1717138373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b206694e2852f2c6734ae27d545e87f3.webm?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b206694e2852f2c6734ae27d545e87f3.mp4?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this epic party-based RPG, challenge the prevailing lies of a Kingdom suffocating under deceit. Will you be the beacon of hope Vendir so desperately needs, or will you falter and let darkness consume all?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><strong>CRPG-Classic Ambiance in a Dynamic World:</strong><br>Set foot in a sprawling, interactive world that reverberates with the essence of classic computer role-playing games. From bustling towns to eerie dungeons, the Land of Vendir beckons for exploration.<br><br><strong>Engaging Turn-Based Combat:</strong><br>Dive into strategic battles that fuse intuitive mechanics with depth. Choose to engage with melee, spells, or a blend of both, and exploit enemy weaknesses to claim victory.<br><br><strong>Extensive Exploration and Loot System:</strong><br>Traverse the diverse terrains of Vendir, uncovering secrets, treasures, and lore. Equip and upgrade gear, and delve into the connection between items and the overarching narrative.<br><br><strong>Deep Character Customization:</strong><br>With a vast skill tree boasting hundreds of abilities, tailor your characters based on your playstyle. Choose from classes like Warrior, Thief, Necromancer, and Mage, and experiment with synergies for varied gameplay experiences.<br><br><strong>Choice-Driven Narrative:</strong><br>Interact with NPCs in dialogues rich in lore, where your choices carve out the story's direction. Every decision could have ramifications, leading to multiple story outcomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><br>Embark on a harrowing journey in a land where darkness overshadows hope. The Land of Vendir, tainted by the Royal Family's oppressive reign, is a realm of despair, where life's value is less than the mud on one's boots.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b0ad53e96496acf2ef7daf9eb1890a5b.poster.avif?t=1717138373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b0ad53e96496acf2ef7daf9eb1890a5b.webm?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b0ad53e96496acf2ef7daf9eb1890a5b.mp4?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Amidst the chaos, whispers of an ancient prophecy surface, proclaiming the rise of heroes who would challenge the throne. But in a world where public intoxication leads to execution, and debts unpaid result in a fiery death, do these foretold saviors dare to rise?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/991c701fae6635e4477d0349aa8571f5.poster.avif?t=1717138373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/991c701fae6635e4477d0349aa8571f5.webm?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/991c701fae6635e4477d0349aa8571f5.mp4?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Journey across the treacherous landscapes of Vendir, rallying allies and avoiding King Elrik's wrathful gaze. As the Eighth Era unfolds, destiny awaits the brave.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b206694e2852f2c6734ae27d545e87f3.poster.avif?t=1717138373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b206694e2852f2c6734ae27d545e87f3.webm?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478850/extras/b206694e2852f2c6734ae27d545e87f3.mp4?t=1717138373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this epic party-based RPG, challenge the prevailing lies of a Kingdom suffocating under deceit. Will you be the beacon of hope Vendir so desperately needs, or will you falter and let darkness consume all?",
